# Cau hinh dung rieng khi build ban phat hanh (`npm run build`), Vite tu
# nap file nay va ghi de len `.env` cho che do production.
#
# Trien khai san xuat: Backend FastAPI phuc vu luon ban tinh Frontend qua
# cung 1 cong (xem app/main.py, muc "Phuc vu Frontend tinh (SPA)"). De
# VITE_API_BASE_URL rong -> Frontend goi API bang duong dan TUONG DOI, luon
# trung goc (origin) voi trang dang mo -> hoat dong dung du nguoi dung truy
# cap qua http://localhost:8000 hay qua IP LAN cua may chu
# (http://192.168.x.x:8000), khong can build lai cho tung may chu.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
